        },
        {
          "text": "Arambgira, ati Mwana w’umuntu, aha hantu n’ah’ intebe yanje y’ubgami, n’ ahantu ibirenge vyanje bizohora bishinze, ni ho nzobana n’Abisirayeli ndi hagati muri bo gushitsa ibihe bidashira: kand’ ab’ inzu ya Isirayeli ntibazokwongera kwanduza izina ryanje ryera ukundi, bo ubgabo, cank’ abami babo, ngo baryandurishe ubumaka bgabo, cank’ imivyimba y’abami babo iri mu ntatemwa zabo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
