              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 44:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze ni bamāramāzwa n’ivyo bākoze vyose, ubamenyeshe iyo ngoro ukw isa, n’ imyubakire yayo ukw imeze, no mw isohokero ry’irebe ryayo no mu rwinjiriro rwayo, n’ukw imeze hose, n’amabgirizwa yayo yose, n’ukw isa hose, n’ivyagezwe vyayo vyose; uvyandikire imbere yabo, kugira ngo bame bibuka ukw isa yose, n’amabgirizwa yayo yose, kugira ngo bayitondere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.11"
            ]
          }
        },
