              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ aya az’ abe ari yo matambge y’igicaniro, y’ukuboko uciriye mu nkokora (itambge ryose rize rirenzekw itambge ry’intoke): intebe yaco, uburebure bg’igihagararo bube itambge rimwe, no mw iniguriro ryayo aho rigera, bube itambge rimwe nyene; n’ umubuga wayo uyikikuje ube uw’ itambge rimwe ry’intoke; uko ni kw intebe y’igicaniro ikwiye kumera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Guhera ku ntebe hasi gushitsa ku ntera y’ahahera hepfo, habe amatambge abiri y’ukuboko uciriye mu nkokora, no mw iniguriro ry’iyo ntera aho rigera, habe itambge rimwe; kandi guhera kur’ iyo ntera ngufi ugashitsa ku ntera ndende habe amatambge ane, no mw iniguriro ry’iyo ntera aho rigera, habe itambge rimwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N’ ahahera hejuru ku gicaniro habe amatambge ane; kandi hejuru ku gicaniro ahacanwa nyene haze hashingwe amahembe ane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho gucanwa, uburebure bg’amakika bgaho bube amatambge cumi n’ abiri, n’ubgaguke bube icumi n’ abiri nyene, impande zose ukw ari zine zingane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.20.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuv 20:26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ intera gihagazeko, uburebure bgayo bg’ amakika bube amatambge cumi n’ane, n’ubgaguke bube icumi n’ane nyene, impande zose ukw ari zine zingane; umubuga wayo uyikikuje ugende ar’ igihimba c’itambge ry’ukuboko uciriye mu nkokora, no mw iniguriro aho rigera rigende ar’ itambge rimwe impande zose. Ingazi yaco iherēre i burasirazuba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
